                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.77/2603: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul at Harbin</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Hanson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-07-12T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 12, 1922—6
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>For Stevens. Your July 8, 6 p.m. Matter has been brought to attention Chinese
                    Foreign Office by Legation Peking.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
